  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe DXF reader skips the sections that carry no geometry (CLASSES, ACDSDATA, THUMBNAILIMAGE) and refuses a file when a drawable record sits in one of them, so nothing is dropped silently. It knows a record is drawable from `ENTITY_KINDS` in `crates/geometry/src/dxf/entities.rs`. That list lacked `MPOLYGON` and the six SURFACE subtypes (`EXTRUDEDSURFACE`, `LOFTEDSURFACE`, `NURBSURFACE`, `PLANESURFACE`, `REVOLVEDSURFACE`, `SWEPTSURFACE`). They are on the list now (46 to 53 names).\n\n`SUN` stays off the list on purpose. It is in the ENTITIES chapter of the DXF Reference, but AutoCAD writes it in OBJECTS (subclass `AcDbSun`, no `AcDbEntity`), and the OBJECTS reader refuses every kind on this list as \"graphical entity in OBJECTS\". Adding it would refuse real AutoCAD files with sun settings. A comment above the list says so.\n\n## How tested\n\n- New `dxf_classes_section::mpolygon_and_the_surface_kinds_in_a_section_without_geometry_are_refused`: each of the seven kinds in each of the three inert sections is a named refusal. It fails without the change.\n- New `dxf_objects_section::a_sun_object_in_objects_stays_inert`: a SUN object in OBJECTS imports the same entities as the file without it.\n- All DXF suites pass (`dxf`, `dxf_classes_section`, `dxf_objects_section`, `dxf_inert_sections`, `dxf_refusals`).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick` on Windows: 1203 of 1206 steps pass, clippy clean. The three failures do not touch DXF and come from this checkout: `sinumerik_810m_post::air_cut_kit_posts_cleanly_and_matches_committed_kit` (the golden `.mpf` was checked out with CRLF line endings), `catalog_render::catalog_cases_open_and_frame_cleanly` (`rough-finish`: \"its file changed\", the same line-ending cause) and `egui_app` (the test binary stops with an access violation, a GPU driver crash here).\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo real DXF file with MPOLYGON or a surface record in an inert section was opened; the tests use synthetic records.\n\nChangelog: DXF import refuses a damaged file that hides an MPOLYGON or 3D surface record in a section without geometry, instead of dropping it silently.\nEffort: low\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nFixes #3683\n",
